<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρί̄ν-ῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>made from the</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῖνος, γύης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					429
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνθρακες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					668
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ πρίνιναι</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βάλανοι</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.106.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὕλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					49.3.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύκητες π.</span> fungi <i>that
				grow under the ilex,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				227.11
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.Ox.</u>
				3.231
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>oaken,</i> i.e. <i>tough, sturdy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέροντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					180
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ λίαν στρυφνὸν καὶ π. ἦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>V.</u>
					877
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθληταί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.37
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Diosc.
			</span></i>) (rejected by <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> in favour of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φήγινος</span> for
			reasons of euphony, acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				2.9
			</span></i>).</div>
